{"id":"6af3724906d8a547","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-convergent-series.md","title":"Convergent Series","display":"df-convergent-series — Convergent Series","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-convergent-series","aliases":["58-df-convergent-series","Convergent Series"],"display":"df-convergent-series — Convergent Series","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-sequence.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-convergent-series"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-convergent-series</span><span>Convergent Series</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-convergent-series — Convergent Series"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d8eb5064b65f8a92\" href=\"?note=d8eb5064b65f8a92\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sequence.md\">../batch08/58-df-sequence.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_\\bullet\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\land S\\in\\mathbb C\">\\(a_\\bullet\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\land S\\in\\mathbb C\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sequence}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sequence}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d8eb5064b65f8a92\" href=\"?note=d8eb5064b65f8a92\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sequence.md\">../batch08/58-df-sequence.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConvSeries}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConvSeries}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}convergent\\text{-}series} \\vdash \\mathrm{ConvSeries}_S(a_\\bullet,S)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Sequence}_S(a_\\bullet,\\mathbb C)\\land S\\in\\mathbb C\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\left(m\\geq N\\to\\left|\\sum_{n&lt;m}a_n-S\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}convergent\\text{-}series} \\vdash \\mathrm{ConvSeries}_S(a_\\bullet,S)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Sequence}_S(a_\\bullet,\\mathbb C)\\land S\\in\\mathbb C\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\left(m\\geq N\\to\\left|\\sum_{n&lt;m}a_n-S\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Convergence: partial sums converge; Cauchy criterion: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|S_m - S_n| &lt; \\epsilon\">\\(|S_m - S_n| &lt; \\epsilon\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m, n &gt; N\">\\(m, n &gt; N\\)</span></li>\n<li>Absolute convergence: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum |a_n| &lt; \\infty \\implies \\sum a_n\">\\(\\sum |a_n| &lt; \\infty \\implies \\sum a_n\\)</span> converges; terms can be rearranged</li>\n<li>Conditional convergence: converges but not absolutely; e.g. alternating harmonic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum (-1)^{n+1}/n\">\\(\\sum (-1)^{n+1}/n\\)</span></li>\n<li>Tests: comparison, ratio, root, Dirichlet, Abel, Raabe</li>\n<li>Rearrangement: Riemann: conditional but not absolute series can be rearranged to converge to any sum</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Principles of Mathematical Analysis</li>\n<li>Apostol, Mathematical Analysis</li>\n<li>Abbott, Understanding Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"d8eb5064b65f8a92","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-sequence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"d8eb5064b65f8a92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sequence}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch08/58-df-sequence.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a_\\bullet\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\land S\\in\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sequence}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConvSeries}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}convergent\\text{-}series} \\vdash \\mathrm{ConvSeries}_S(a_\\bullet,S)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Sequence}_S(a_\\bullet,\\mathbb C)\\land S\\in\\mathbb C\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\left(m\\geq N\\to\\left|\\sum_{n<m}a_n-S\\right|<\\varepsilon\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"|S_m - S_n| < \\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"m, n > N","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum |a_n| < \\infty \\implies \\sum a_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum (-1)^{n+1}/n","display":false}],"bytes":1442,"backlinks":[{"id":"5325dffa06d7e6a9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ConvSeries}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (convergent-series predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-convergent-series.md]])"},{"id":"4905b9f2ba0c83f8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-365","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-convergent-series.md|58-df-convergent-series]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["d8eb5064b65f8a92"]}